# Sakrylle Image — Core

Pure frontend SPA: React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 6 + Tailwind 3 + Zustand 5 + i18next. No backend — static deploy only. Data in browser IndexedDB.

- **Repo**: `Ranshen1209/sakrylle-image`, branch `theme/sakrylle`
- **Upstream**: [CookSleep/gpt_image_playground](https://github.com/CookSleep/gpt_image_playground) (MIT) — keep multi-provider code (OpenAI / fal.ai / custom HTTP); change defaults only, never delete provider paths
- **Production**: `image.sakrylle.com`
- **Default API**: `https://api.sakrylle.com/v1` (no trailing slash)

## Ecosystem role

Users OAuth-login or paste API keys from sub.sakrylle.com. This app handles UI / history / gallery / mask editor / Agent chat. Image calls hit `api.sakrylle.com/v1/images/*` → sub2api → `ai.centos.hk`.

## Key constraints

- Images model: `gpt-image-2` only (`DEFAULT_IMAGES_MODEL` in `apiProfiles.ts`)
- Agent Responses model: `gpt-5.5` — requires GPT-Pro/Plus group key (one key = one group)
- GPT-Image group: `group_id=5`, `allow_image_generation=true`, $0.15/request
- Billing: per_request only; UI shows ￥; failures are not charged
- Codex CLI compat mode: default off (Sakrylle is not Codex upstream)
- `PROMPT_REWRITE_GUARD_PREFIX` in `openaiCompatibleImageApi.ts` — Responses API must not rewrite prompts

